{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, pick up, process, move or move randomly if stuck. Execute in order.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = MoveRandomly    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsRobotStuck    />",
